# Courtyard Stories — UI & performance (Pass 4)

## Tokens

- Page base **`#07091A`** on landing; nav pill **`#0F1530`**; loader night **`#0A0F1F`**.
- `data-theme="night"` default (see `public/courtyard-theme-preview.html`).
- Syne display · Instrument Sans body · marigold CTA `#FF9F1C`.

## Navbar

Centred 56px pill; **Courtyard Stories** one line; Work / Services / Studio / Visit + single Enquire CTA; Menu ≤820px; hide on scroll via `transform` only; **no backdrop-filter**.

## Motion (mandatory)

- **`src/lib/motion.ts`** — scroll-linked writes on **`transform` / `opacity`** only; after GSAP loads, **`gsap.ticker`** drives the same dirty loop (one rAF path).
- **`src/lib/gsap.ts`** + **`src/components/cards/useCardAnimation.ts`** — Five worlds / `SplitCard` entrance (Pass 5); `ScrollTrigger.refresh()` after loader, fonts, images; **`prefers-reduced-motion`** skips timelines; 1.5s reveal safety still applies.
- **No per-frame React state** for scroll or drag.
- Cache layout in **`useMotionSection.ts`** (`ResizeObserver`); no layout reads in the scroll frame.
- **LazyViewportVideo** — max 2 playing; hero featured set hover only on landing.
- Studio: drag plane + inertia; keyboard pan; list view for a11y.
- **No WebGL / Three.js** in the app runtime.

## Landing / Studio

- Section colour bands (`home-landing.css`); `--section-y: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px)`.
- **SplitCard** half image / half text for sets, visit grid, portfolio rails.
- Pinned rail: `scrollProgressWithDwell`, remeasure on `tcs:loader-done` + ResizeObserver.
- **Reveal:** content visible by default; `html.js-reveal` hides until `.in` + 1500ms safety (`src/lib/reveal.ts`).
- `/studio`: `html.studio-route` locks scroll; footer hidden; fixed explorer; HUD pills bottom.
- Loader exit: hold at 100% → arch `.done` settle → smooth overlay fade (`exit-fade`); no slide-up; dispatch `tcs:loader-done`.
- Route change: focus `#main`, not brand (`:focus-visible` only on nav).

See `FRONTEND-UI-INVENTORY.md` §7.